WEBVTT

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.016
(Laughter)

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.536
He said, "Let me get some."
I said, "N-O. No."

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.776
(Laughter)

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.216
It was awesome.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.416
I mean, I can actually now
for the first time in my life read.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.480
The feeling that I got
from it was amazing.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.840
And then at 22, feeling myself,

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.536
feeling confident,

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.400
I remembered what the OG told me.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.496
So I picked up the business section
of the newspaper.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.456
I wanted to find these rich white folks.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.080
(Laughter)